        <item>
            <title>3.8.5</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 18:15:40 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>139</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.8.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.8.5</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Larger, easier-to-click checkboxes in AI Rename</li><li>Rename ready files while other items in the batch are still being analyzed</li><li>Clearer selection layout and smaller warning icons</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Fixed checkbox clicks for very wide image previews</li><li>A completed rename no longer appears to fail if Activity or usage syncing is temporarily unavailable</li></ul>
]]></description>
